{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the void</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Void Drift</strong> is a fast-paced\u00a0roguelike space shooter  where you explore vast, enemy-filled battlefields, upgrade your ship, and take on relentless waves of enemies and powerful bosses. Fight through dynamic, open-ended levels where you choose your own approach\u2014dodge incoming fire, hunt for enemies, or dive straight into the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491090/extras/519fcf0d6c7f14b9dbc32749f838cfe2.poster.avif?t=1762350749\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491090/extras/519fcf0d6c7f14b9dbc32749f838cfe2.webm?t=1762350749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491090/extras/519fcf0d6c7f14b9dbc32749f838cfe2.mp4?t=1762350749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start simple, but as you progress, you'll unlock powerful upgrades that <strong>evolve</strong> your weapons into devastating new forms. Adapt to every encounter by combining different enhancements, creating unique playstyles that match your strategy. Whether you prefer precise, high-damage shots or overwhelming area destruction, the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491090/extras/4857aece650b11e3ec22fd50ebe025d3.poster.avif?t=1762350749\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491090/extras/4857aece650b11e3ec22fd50ebe025d3.webm?t=1762350749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491090/extras/4857aece650b11e3ec22fd50ebe025d3.mp4?t=1762350749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face Bosses. </strong>Every level culminates in a unique<strong> </strong>boss battle that will test your reflexes, strategy, and firepower. No two encounters are the same\u2014learn their attack patterns, find their weaknesses, and bring them down before they crush you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore, Survive. </strong>Each level is a unique battlefield filled with deadly enemies, landmarks, and unique challenges. Survive relentless waves of foes and uncover secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your Arsenal. </strong>Start with a simple weapon, then upgrade and evolve it into a devastating force of destruction. Adapt to the battlefield by choosing the right upgrades, combining weapons for new abilities, and forging your own path to victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Progression</strong>. Experiment with upgrades and strategies to improve with each run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong>. Procedural elements and evolving weapons ensure no two runs are the same.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Slayer I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3491090/2610068f62d71badbc962859ac7164a7aab5ec6a.jpg"},{"name":"Slayer II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3491090/99647f24caec1d2437133c1abc2e22934b4000ca.jpg"},{"name":"Slayer III","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3491090/b75b3258289811e2ab8e42e231d5c089e3a48e06.jpg"},{"name":"Slayer IV","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3491090/6930f5de71884734b14d85f8da68ec5eb44dcb8c.jpg"},{"name":"Slayer V","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3491090/5f4e9b29579b330fd669a37a2e37796732b0f6c2.jpg"},{"name":"Slayer VI","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3491090/37c3fc95e79ddb66ef755aaa3c4ee87b15814ae0.jpg"},{"name":"Immortal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3491090/37bdb789874ab8caf27857b34c215beda0e875fe.jpg"},{"name":"Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3491090/5e82f346dd169ef5e7aa643d973311dbd8d9052f.jpg"},{"name":"Omega","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3491090/7028453fa950bfaeaf7da027bb96386a08493ab9.jpg"},{"name":"Critical Eye","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3491090/9a1e594af59884206e3dd5b52931449e1b7f4138.jpg"}],"total":16},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3491090?t=1762350749","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491090/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762350749","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491090/69db2506e9d4128725bdcddceace071dafa4bfcb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762350749","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491090/69db2506e9d4128725bdcddceace071dafa4bfcb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762350749","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3961670,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the void</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Void Drift</strong> is a fast-paced\u00a0roguelike space shooter  where you explore vast, enemy-filled battlefields, upgrade your ship, and take on relentless waves of enemies and powerful bosses. Fight through dynamic, open-ended levels where you choose your own approach\u2014dodge incoming fire, hunt for enemies, or dive straight into the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491090/extras/519fcf0d6c7f14b9dbc32749f838cfe2.poster.avif?t=1762350749\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491090/extras/519fcf0d6c7f14b9dbc32749f838cfe2.webm?t=1762350749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491090/extras/519fcf0d6c7f14b9dbc32749f838cfe2.mp4?t=1762350749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start simple, but as you progress, you'll unlock powerful upgrades that <strong>evolve</strong> your weapons into devastating new forms. Adapt to every encounter by combining different enhancements, creating unique playstyles that match your strategy. Whether you prefer precise, high-damage shots or overwhelming area destruction, the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491090/extras/4857aece650b11e3ec22fd50ebe025d3.poster.avif?t=1762350749\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491090/extras/4857aece650b11e3ec22fd50ebe025d3.webm?t=1762350749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491090/extras/4857aece650b11e3ec22fd50ebe025d3.mp4?t=1762350749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face Bosses. </strong>Every level culminates in a unique<strong> </strong>boss battle that will test your reflexes, strategy, and firepower. No two encounters are the same\u2014learn their attack patterns, find their weaknesses, and bring them down before they crush you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore, Survive. </strong>Each level is a unique battlefield filled with deadly enemies, landmarks, and unique challenges. Survive relentless waves of foes and uncover secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your Arsenal. </strong>Start with a simple weapon, then upgrade and evolve it into a devastating force of destruction. Adapt to the battlefield by choosing the right upgrades, combining weapons for new abilities, and forging your own path to victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Progression</strong>. Experiment with upgrades and strategies to improve with each run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong>. Procedural elements and evolving weapons ensure no two runs are the same.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Kneedlik"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491090/header.jpg?t=1762350749","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3491090/818610/278dd29b9b0923ed36b655496747c45d5f297e3f/1750855559/dash_av1.mpd?t=1738911405","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3491090/818610/278dd29b9b0923ed36b6